 toss the book out of the  arena to prevent the snowman getting the  book  it eventually corners them and tries to  destroy the glass but hannah's father  appears from behind and sucks the beast  back into the book  he then furiously orders the teenagers  to get into the car  on their way zach and champ eventually  realized that hannah's father is  actually r.l stein the author of the  goosebumps stories who disappeared a  long time ago  upon arrival stein orders the boys to  return home while he starts packing his  stuff to move to another town again  however they insist on staying in urge  stein to explain what is actually  happening  he reveals that he created his own  friends to terrorize his neighborhood  since he was not allowed to leave the  house and they bullied him for that he  adds that one day the creatures from the  books became real this he had to lock  them  stein walks to the bookcase to gather  all the books but he then finds out that  one of the evilest creatures slappy has  leapt off from the book  he burns his own book so that stein  cannot put him back into custody again  slappy takes all the books and unleashes  several horrifying creatures along the  way which haunt the entire town because  of the invasion the town's communication  has been brought down on the other hand  stein and the teenagers run to the  kitchen only to find a horde of  murderous dwarfs that are ready to  attack them they attempt to smash the  dwarfs into pieces but they are then  overwhelmed when the dwarfs keep putting  their pieces back together forcing them  to flee to the basement and escape from  the house stein and the others find all  the books have been burned to prevent  the creatures being sucked back  back to slappy he brings two aliens to  the police station where they freeze the  rookie officers with their fancy weapons  stein and the teenagers arrive at the  center of the town where the creatures  indeed caused a total mess  zach suggests stein writes a new  