 him and they even  laugh at him until the giant mantis  breaks through the ceiling and captures  a teacher  everyone starts running for their life  and seals off the exit door for safety  while slappy keeps unleashing more and  more creatures  after the army is formed slappy gives  the monsters a mission which is to get  rid of stein  the creatures break into the creature  and start attacking the students and the  school staff  the werewolf gets into the school  corridor and almost attacks champs crush  until the hero shows up and bites the  werewolf with his silver filings  his crush is impressed with champ's  bravery and rewards him with a kiss on  the lips meanwhile slappy eventually  locates stein and breaks his fingers  before he can finish the story  zach and hannah grab the typewriter and  are attacked by a murderous plant while  running through the corridor  the students and the staff gather at the  basketball court while the monsters are  trying to break in  realizing that the creatures are chasing  after stein zak comes up with an idea to  lure the creatures out of the school  with the decoy school bus and use  explosives from the chem lab to blow out  the monsters and buy some time for them  stein and the teenagers come back to the  abandoned amusement park and decide to  hide in the house of mirrors  not long after slappy follows them into  the fun house and chastises stein for  locking him up in the book  he then unleashes the blob that ate  everyone  stein hands over the book pages and  handwriting to zach so that he can  finish the final line just before he  gets caught by the slimy monster  the teenagers climb the ferris wheel and  zack eventually manages to finish the  story as the monsters crawl toward them  the giant mantis attacks the ferris  wheel causing it to break and roll  through the woods  the teenagers arrive at an open space  and hannah orders zach to open the book  he initially refuses because that means  that he will lose hannah too and he is  not ready for that turns out that hannah  has known the truth about her too and  she finally opens the book for him  creating a huge portal that pulls all  the monsters back into the book  slappy holds on to stein for a while  until he kicks the evil creature and it  flies back into the book  finally hannah who turns into blue  transparent form gives the last kiss to  zach before slowly getting pulled back  to the book  after that the town is recovering from  the massive damage caused by the  creatures and the students returned to  the school  stein also becomes the new english  teacher at zack school after class stein  gives a surprise to zack by bringing  hannah back to life  he then burns the manuscript so that the  couple can stay together  the new teacher then goes over to check  on his magical typewriter turns out that  the invisible boy was not sucked back  into the book and he starts typing a  manuscript titled the invisible boy's  revenge  the creature greets stein as he screams  in fear  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching

